1454
01:03:09.040 --> 01:03:09.880
I pick up things.

1455
01:03:09.880 --> 01:03:10.900
I thump them.

1456
01:03:11.020 --> 01:03:12.160
I smell them.

1457
01:03:12.440 --> 01:03:13.300
No, lady.

1458
01:03:13.480 --> 01:03:13.680
Uh-oh.

1459
01:03:13.680 --> 01:03:14.280
Don't do it.

1460
01:03:14.320 --> 01:03:14.600
Uh-oh.

1461
01:03:14.600 --> 01:03:18.020
If you go to a farmer's market in France, here's my hot tip for you.

1462
01:03:18.080 --> 01:03:19.260
Don't thump the melon.

1463
01:03:19.500 --> 01:03:20.540
Don't thump the melon.

1464
01:03:20.540 --> 01:03:21.900
Don't thump the melon in France.

1465
01:03:21.940 --> 01:03:22.420
Okay?

1466
01:03:22.620 --> 01:03:22.840
Okay.

