I believe that's French.

1476
01:03:44.960 --> 01:03:45.220
Mm-hmm.

1477
01:03:45.220 --> 01:03:53.440
The faux pas of touching the fruit, and this woman turns to her co-worker and goes off on

1478
01:03:53.440 --> 01:03:53.660
