1486
01:04:19.800 --> 01:04:21.720
I'm a nice person.

1487
01:04:23.120 --> 01:04:24.840
I'm not a bad person.

1488
01:04:24.840 --> 01:04:26.740
I'm sorry I picked up that banana.

1489
01:04:27.160 --> 01:04:35.900
And Angela, this fluent French spilled out of my mouth at this woman, and in French, I

