01:04:35.900 --> 01:04:41.880
suddenly had the command to say, I'm so sorry, but in the United States, we pick our own

1491
01:04:41.880 --> 01:04:42.200
fruit.

1492
01:04:42.360 --> 01:04:43.700
I didn't know about your custom.

1493
01:04:43.700 --> 01:04:47.520
I apologize, but you don't need to say nasty things about me.

1494
01:04:48.000 --> 01:04:54.040
And the look on her face was like, oh, because she certainly didn't think that the fruit-touching

1495
01:04:54.040 --> 01:04:56.880
American could speak French or understand French.

